---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility & Passenger Assistance · TVC Cherry Capital Airport"
  description="TVC accessibility services, WCAG 2.2 AA standards, TSA Cares guidance, wheelchair assistance, service animal relief areas, and accessible parking."
>
  <div class="page-header-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/airport-guide">Airport Guide</a> / <span>Accessibility</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Accessibility & Passenger Assistance</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">Committed to providing an accessible, dignified travel experience for all passengers and visitors.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="a11y-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="app-subnav">
        <a href="/airport-guide" class="subnav-btn">☕ Terminal Amenities</a>
        <a href="/airport-guide/accessibility" class="subnav-btn active">♿ Accessibility & TSA Cares</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Real-Time TSA Wait Time & Security Status Gauge -->
      <div class="wait-time-card tvc-card mb-8">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center flex-wrap gap-4 mb-4">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">LIVE CHECKPOINT METRICS</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-dark">🛡️ TSA Security Checkpoint Status</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-300">
            ● Checkpoint Lanes Open · Updated 2 mins ago
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border text-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase block mb-1">Standard Security Lane</span>
            <div class="text-3xl font-black text-navy-dark">5–8 min</div>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 block mt-1">Normal Passenger Flow</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 text-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase block mb-1">TSA PreCheck® Dedicated Lane</span>
            <div class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-950">&lt; 2 min</div>
            <span class="text-xs text-emerald-800 block mt-1">Expedited Screening Active</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 text-center flex flex-direction-col justify-center items-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-800 uppercase block mb-1">TSA Cares Reservation</span>
            <a href="https://www.tsa.gov/travel/tsa-cares" target="_blank" class="btn btn-navy btn-sm mt-1">Request Assistance ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- WCAG Declaration Banner -->
      <div class="declaration-card tvc-card mb-8">
        <div class="dec-flex">
          <div class="dec-icon">♿</div>
          <div>
            <span class="dec-badge">WCAG 2.2 LEVEL AA CONFORMANCE TARGET</span>
            <h2>Digital & Physical Accessibility Commitment</h2>
            <p>
              The Northwest Regional Airport Authority (NRAA) ensures both physical airport facilities and web communications comply with ADA Standards for Accessible Design and WCAG 2.2 AA specifications.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="a11y-grid">
        <!-- Wheelchair Assistance -->
        <div class="a11y-card tvc-card">
          <h3>👩‍🦽 Wheelchair & Airline Assistance</h3>
          <p>Wheelchair assistance from curbside drop-off to boarding gate is provided free of charge by your departing airline.</p>
          <ul class="a11y-list">
            <li>✓ Request assistance when booking your ticket or at check-in</li>
            <li>✓ Skycap assistance available at main entrance curb</li>
            <li>✓ Accessible jet bridges and ramp loading equipment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- TSA Cares -->
        <div class="a11y-card tvc-card">
          <h3>🛡️ TSA Cares Security Assistance</h3>
          <p>TSA Cares provides dedicated security screening support for travelers with disabilities, medical conditions, or special circumstances.</p>
          <ul class="a11y-list">
            <li>✓ Call TSA Cares at <strong>(855) 787-2227</strong> 72 hrs prior</li>
            <li>✓ Dedicated screening room available upon request</li>
            <li>✓ Passenger Support Specialists on site</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Service Animals -->
        <div class="a11y-card tvc-card">
          <h3>🐕 Service Animal Relief Areas</h3>
          <p>TVC provides designated relief areas equipped with artificial turf, waste disposal bags, and freshwater sinks.</p>
          <ul class="a11y-list">
            <li>✓ Pre-Security: Outdoor lawn adjacent to Baggage Claim</li>
            <li>✓ Post-Security: Secure indoor pet relief room near Gate 4</li>
            <li>✓ Fully ADA compliant & wheelchair accessible</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Accessible Parking -->
        <div class="a11y-card tvc-card">
          <h3>🅿️ Accessible Parking & Curb Access</h3>
          <p>Designated accessible parking spaces are available in Short Term, Long Term, and Economy lots closest to walkways.</p>
          <ul class="a11y-list">
            <li>✓ Van-accessible spaces with side access aisles</li>
            <li>✓ Curbside drop-off ramp zones at main terminal</li>
            <li>✓ Automated pay stations with audio prompts</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Alternative Format Contact Form -->
      <div class="contact-form-card tvc-card mt-12">
        <h2>Request Alternative Format or Accessibility Feedback</h2>
        <p>If you encounter any accessibility barrier at TVC or require public documents in large print, braille, or audio format, please contact our ADA Coordinator.</p>

        <form class="a11y-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you. Your accessibility request has been received by NRAA ADA Compliance.');">
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Full Name *</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" required class="form-input" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email Address *</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" required class="form-input" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group mt-4">
            <label for="details">Describe Accessibility Need or Document Request *</label>
            <textarea id="details" rows="4" required class="form-input"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-4">Submit Request →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-navy-dark) 0%, var(--color-navy) 100%); color: white; padding: 40px 0; }
  .breadcrumb { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #CBD5E1; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; color: white; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .page-intro { color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 1.05rem; }

  .a11y-section { padding: 40px 0 80px; }

  .app-subnav { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .subnav-btn { background-color: white; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy-dark); font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .subnav-btn.active { background-color: var(--color-navy); color: white; }

  .declaration-card { background: #E0F2FE; border-color: #0284C7; }
  .dec-flex { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .dec-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; }
  .dec-badge { background: #0284C7; color: white; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .declaration-card h2 { color: var(--color-navy-dark); margin: 6px 0; font-size: 1.5rem; }

  .a11y-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .a11y-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  .a11y-card h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-navy-dark); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .a11y-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .a11y-list { list-style: none; font-size: 0.88rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; color: var(--color-text-main); }

  .mt-12 { margin-top: 48px; }
  .contact-form-card h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-navy-dark); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .contact-form-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  
  .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .form-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-navy-dark); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .form-input { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .mt-4 { margin-top: 16px; }
</style>
